Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...wift => __Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...ueueDoubleEnded where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} | 0
 .../{Queue.DoubleEnded+Columns.swift => __QueueDoubleEnded.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Primitive/{Queue.DoubleEnded.FrontDoor.swift => __Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Small Primitive/{Queue.DoubleEnded.Small.swift => __QueueDoubleEnded where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Queue DoubleEnded/{Queue.DoubleEnded+Columns.swift => __QueueDoubleEnded.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Primitive/Queue.DoubleEnded.FrontDoor.swift b/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Primitive/Queue.DoubleEnded.FrontDoor.swift
rename to Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Small Primitive/Queue.DoubleEnded.Small.swift b/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Small Primitive/__QueueDoubleEnded where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Small Primitive/Queue.DoubleEnded.Small.swift
rename to Sources/Queue DoubleEnded Small Primitive/__QueueDoubleEnded where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded/Queue.DoubleEnded+Columns.swift b/Sources/Queue DoubleEnded/__QueueDoubleEnded.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue DoubleEnded/Queue.DoubleEnded+Columns.swift
rename to Sources/Queue DoubleEnded/__QueueDoubleEnded.swift
